                                                    "value": {
                                                        "code": null,
                                                        "comment": "",
                                                        "message": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Focus on High-impact Error Codes</strong></span></p>\n<p>Prioritize errors that have the greatest business consequence:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Criticality</strong> &mdash; Emphasize and prioritize business-critical errors first.</li>\n<li><strong>Leadership alignment</strong> &mdash; Align prioritization with business goals and leadership direction.</li>\n<li><strong>Error count</strong>&nbsp;&mdash; High count error codes reduce overall volume; low count error codes reduce error categories.</li>\n<li><strong>Recurring errors</strong>&nbsp;&mdash; Address errors with high consecutive counts via remediation or Suppress/Ignore to reduce noise.</li>\n<li><strong>Support mapping</strong>&nbsp;&mdash; Target errors mapped to defined support groups for faster resolution.</li>\n<li><strong>Phase</strong>&nbsp;&mdash; Begin with initial phases (Configuration, Design, Access Credential) then promote to higher phases.</li>\n<li><strong>Enriched context</strong>&nbsp;&mdash; Leverage additional information gathered via enrichment.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Find quick wins</strong></span></p>\n<p>Look for errors where a single fix resolves many instances:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Global fix</strong>&nbsp;&mdash; A single fix that resolves many instances has the highest return on effort.</li>\n<li><strong>Shared root cause</strong>&nbsp;&mdash; Multiple errors pointing to the same root cause or remediation. One fix clears them all.</li>\n<li><strong>Available action</strong>&nbsp;&mdash; Error codes with a pre-configured remediation action (check the Error Action page) can be resolved fastest.</li>\n<li><strong>Low effort</strong> &mdash; Credential rotation, certificate renewal, or config updates typically take under 15 minutes with no restart required.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Enable AI-powered Prioritization</span></strong></p>\n<p>Get&nbsp;<strong>automated insights tailored to your environment</strong>&nbsp;to help you identify the highest impact errors and quick wins by&nbsp;<a href=\"/now/now-assist-admin/plugins/params/workflow/00202261eb383110da1861c59c5228e4/t/1775208065474\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">enabling Now Assist for Error Framework.</a></p>"
                                                    }
